Models and data you use with SLM Forge
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

SLM Forge downloads base models and datasets from the Hugging Face Hub at your request; none are
included here. They stay under their own licences, and a model you train inherits the conditions
of its base model and training data. Every export records them in its model card and copies the
base model's licence files. Training data written or reviewed by OpenAI models is subject to
OpenAI's terms.
